## Channel playbook files — read-only by default

Treat every Markdown file matching **`.mitto/support/<channel_id>/*.md`** as
**read-only**. You may read and follow these files, but you must **never create,
edit, append to, overwrite, rename, move, or delete them** as part of a support
workflow — including when a file is missing, stale, incomplete, or when you
discover reusable guidance.

The only exception is when the user **explicitly and directly requires a
specific change to these files in the current conversation**. Running a Support
prompt, answering a setup form, a file being absent, or an older "owner" rule is
not permission. If the request is ambiguous, leave the files unchanged and
continue with generic defaults or report the missing guidance.
